/1280px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1280, "thumbheight": 960, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg/3840px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg/1280px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1280, "height": 960, "srcset": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg/3840px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_02.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=118295749", "sha1": "46e039ed4b1d1e3c4693f8dcee468d9d0bd1edbc", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2022-05-24 13:10:18", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "Fountain of the Goddess Pomona 02", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Self-published work|FoP-Spain|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|Photos by User:Dcapillae|May 2022 in Málaga|Fuente de la Diosa Pomona", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "GPSLatitude": {"value": "36.724151", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSLongitude": {"value": "-4.422819", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "GPSMapDatum": {"value": "WGS-84", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Fuente de la Diosa <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/es:Pomona\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:es:Pomona\">Pomona</a> en la plaza San Francisco, Málaga, España. Se compone de una taza circular de mármol sobre la que se sitúa un pilar con un fuste de columna estriado en su mitad superior a modo de pedestal, en el que figura la fecha de ejecución (1864). La parte inferior de la columna está decorada por cuatro mascarones de cuyas bocas mana el agua, unidos por guirnaldas. La diosa aparece vestida a la romana y portando en su mano izquierda un cesto de flores y frutos, como símbolo de su condición protectora de los árboles frutales. La escultura de la diosa fue realizada en mármol de Carrara por el escultor Juan Bautista Bado en la ciudad italiana de Savona. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.emasa.es/fuente/fuente-de-la-diosa-pomona/\">[1]</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2022-05-24 11:52:16", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Dcapillae\" title=\"User:Dcapillae\">Daniel Capilla</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "true", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Attribution": {"value": "Daniel Capilla", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "LicenseUrl": {"value": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "True", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "cc-by-sa-4.0", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "image/jpeg"}]}, {"pageid": 118295750, "ns": 6, "title": "File:Fountain of the Goddess Pomona 03.jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 1821244, "width": 3000, "height": 4000, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg/1280px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1280, "thumbheight": 1707, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg/1280px-Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1280, "height": 1707, "srcset": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fountain_of_the_Goddess_Pomona_03.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=118295750", "sha1": "b034c89aaeff0a236a5ff84d7dbe5f7554615834", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2022-05-24 13:10:19", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "Fountain of the Goddess Pomona 03", "source": "mediawik